  "uses_raw": true,
  "prompt": "In which months were resent copies loaded, and how many? This table may hold errors. Two lines are copies of one order line when order_id, product_id, quantity, unit_price_eur, promo_id and line_discount_eur all match, with a missing promo_id matching a missing one; every line beyond the first of such a set is a resent copy. The month is the first day of the month of the order's order_ts as stored, such as 2024-06-01. Return two columns, in this order: order_month and n_copies. Return one row for each month with at least one copy. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "order_month",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
      {
        "name": "n_copies",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
